Nobody knows when NYRR will change the qualifying standards for NYRR half marathons. 
To try to anticipate the need for a change, we can look at trends on qualifying via
these shorter races (we could do the same for the marathon, but it probably would
track anyway).

2026:

B2026: 1468 qualified of 30388
26WSHALF: 84 qualified of 5209
H2026: 2046 qualified of 30204
26FLHALF: 0 (cancelled)

2025:

B2025: 1068 qualified of 28472
25WSHALF: 75 qualified of 5041
H2025: 1565 qualified of 28678
25FLHALF: 226 qualified of 4849

2024:

24SIHALF: 437 qualified of 9297
24BKH: 1171 qualified of 28443
24RSHALF: 106 qualified of 8255
H2024: 1410 qualified of 27813
